insert into public.workout_coach_notes (class_date, body) values ('2026-10-27', 'Baseline is one fresh attempt per member; write it on the scorecard with their level (it is retested Tue Dec 15 at the same level).
Scaling: Gentle warm-up: step instead of jumping, walk instead of jogging, comfortable range. Pain: pain-free range, tell the coach.
Conditioning targets: RPE 5–6, not for time. Cap 28:00 · Aim 4 rounds at a pace you could hold for 40 min · Feel cardio · Pace sustain.
No machine (warm-up/cool-down): swap for easy jumping jacks, marching or jump rope, about 1:00 per 250 m or per 5 cal.')
