insert into public.workout_coach_notes (class_date, body) values ('2026-10-29', 'If there aren''t enough rowers and bikes, run the class in two waves: wave 1 does the intervals while wave 2 does the accessory strength, then swap at about minute 31; or send the overflow to the ''No machine free'' bodyweight rounds. The intervals have no outside version on purpose: Thursday is machine-only so weekly running volume stays as planned.
Scaling: Gentle warm-up: step instead of jumping, walk instead of jogging, comfortable range. Masters or injury: today is the best day for extra mobility or rehab work.
Conditioning targets: Zone 2 (full sentences the whole time). RPE: Gentle 3–4, Steady 4, Strong 4–5, Full 5. Cap 19:00 (fixed) · Aim: Gentle same easy pace every round; Steady/Strong/Full row split 0:15–0:25 per 500 m slower than their 1 km test split, bike same calories each round (±1) · Feel cardio (easy) · Pace sustain.
No machine (warm-up/cool-down): swap for easy jumping jacks, marching or jump rope, about 1:00 per 250 m or per 5 cal.')
