in easy bike · doorway chest stretch 1 min each side · box breathing 1 min", "3 min easy bike · doorway chest stretch 1 min each side · box breathing 1 min", "3 min easy bike · doorway chest stretch 1 min each side · box breathing 1 min"]}]'::jsonb, 'published', null)
