insert into public.workout_coach_notes (class_date, body) values ('2026-11-19', 'If there aren''t enough rowers and bikes, run the class in two waves: wave 1 does the intervals while wave 2 does the accessory strength, then swap at about minute 31; or send the overflow to the ''No machine free'' bodyweight rounds. The intervals have no outside version on purpose: Thursday is machine-only so weekly running volume stays as planned.
Warm-up: general 4 min, specific 3 min. Easier warm-up: step instead of jump, walk instead of jog, comfortable range.
Intervals: RPE 3–4 (Gentle), 4 (Steady), 4–5 (Strong), 5 (Full). Zone 2: if they can only say a few words, slow down. Cap 19:00 (fixed). Aim: Gentle same easy pace, could keep going; others row split 0:15–0:25 per 500 m slower than their 1 km test split, bike same calories each round (±1). Feel cardio (easy) · Pace sustain.
Masters or injury: best day for extra mobility or rehab work.
No machine (warm-up/cool-down): jumping jacks, marching or jump rope, ~1:00 per 250 m or 5 cal.')
