nt": "Goblet squat", "mode": "percent", "sets": 3, "reps": 3, "pct": [null, 85, 85, 85], "note": "Ramp: bar × 10, 40% × 5, 50% × 3, 60% × 2. RPE 8 cap."}, "versions": ["Goblet box squat: 3 × 3, easy weight\nKettlebell or dumbbell at your chest, sit to a box at knee height. Leave 3–4 reps in the tank. Rest 2:30–3 min.", "Back squat: 3 × 3 @ 85%\nTop sets, after the ramp set. Rest 2:30–3 min. If a set feels harder than 2 reps left, drop 5–10%.", "Back squat: 3 × 3 @ 85%\nTop sets, after the ramp set. Rest 2:30–3 min. If a set feels harder than 2 reps left, drop 5–10%.", "Back squat: 3 × 3 @ 85%\nTop sets, after the ramp set. Rest 2:30–3 min. If a set feels harder than 2 reps left, drop 5–10%."]}, {"kind": "conditioning", "label": "Conditioning", "title": "Bike/Burpee Rounds", "minutes": 15, "versions": ["3 rounds (12 min):\n1 min max cal air bike · 1 min rest · 1 min max incline step-back burpees (hands on a box) · 1 min rest\nModerate effort. Score = total calories + reps.\nNo bike free? 1 min fast marching or step-jacks.", "3 rounds (12 min):\n1 min max cal air bike · 1 min rest · 1 min max step-back burpees · 1 min rest\nFairly hard. Score = total calories + reps.\nNo bike free? 1 min max jumping jacks.", "3 rounds (12 min):\n1 min max cal air bike · 1 min rest · 1 min max burpees · 1 min rest\nHard. Score = total calories + reps. Knees or back? Step-back burpees.\nNo bike free? 1 min max single-unders.", "3 rounds (12 min):\n1 min max cal air bike · 1 min rest · 1 min max burpees · 1 min rest\nVery hard. Score = total calories + reps. Knees or back? Step-back burpees.\nNo bike free? 1 min max single-unders."]}, {"kind": "skill", "label": "Accessory", "title": "Lunge + plank superset", "minutes": 5, "versions": ["3 rounds, leave 3–4 reps in the tank:\n6 bodyweight walking lunges each side, short steps · 15 s side plank from the knees each side", "3 rounds, leave 2–3 reps in the tank:\n10 bodyweight walking lunges each side · 20 s side plank from the knees each side", "3 rounds, leave 2–3 reps in the tank:\n10 dumbbell walking lunges each side (15/20 lb) · 20 s short-lever Copenhagen plank each side", "3 rounds, leave 2–3 reps in the tank:\n10 dumbbell walking lunges each side (15/20 lb) · 20 s short-lever Copenhagen plank each side"]}, {"kind": "cooldown", "label": "Cool-down", "title": "Cool-down", "minutes": 5, "versions": ["3 min easy bike · couch stretch 1 min each side · child''s pose 1 min\nLog your loads.", "3 min easy bike · couch stretch 1 min each side · child''s pose 1 min\nLog your loads.", "3 min easy bike · couch stretch 1 min each side · child''s pose 1 min\nLog your loads.", "3 min easy bike · couch stretch 1 min each side · child''s pose 1 min\nLog your loads."]}]'::jsonb, 'published', null)
