insert into public.workout_coach_notes (class_date, body) values ('2026-12-10', 'If there aren''t enough rowers and bikes, run the class in two waves: wave 1 does the intervals while wave 2 does the accessory strength, then swap at about minute 31; or send the overflow to the ''No machine free'' bodyweight rounds. The intervals have no outside version on purpose: Thursday is machine-only so weekly running volume stays as planned.
Intervals: Zone 2 (Gentle: slow pedalling fine), full sentences the whole time; if only a few words, slow down. RPE 3–4 Gentle, 4 Steady, 4–5 Strong, 5 Full. Cap 14:00 (fixed) · Aim: same easy pace every round; Steady/Strong/Full row split 0:15–0:25 per 500 m slower than their 1 km test split, bike same calories each round (±1) · Feel: cardio (easy) · Pace: sustain.
Scaling: Masters or injury: today is the best day for extra mobility or rehab work. Gentle warm-up: step instead of jumping, walk instead of jogging, comfortable range.
No machine: warm-up/cool-down machine → jumping jacks, marching or jump rope, ~1:00 per 250 m or 5 cal.')
