insert into public.workout_coach_notes (class_date, body) values ('2026-12-15', 'Flex week: every session is optional (members pick 3–4); guests and on-ramp members join at Steady (Foundations), or Gentle if they need an easier start. Write each retest next to the Week 2 baseline on the scorecard; members retest at the same level as their baseline. The easy flow is air bike only on purpose (no running before Helen and the Mini Challenge; rowers stay free), so no outside version. Short on bikes? Half the class starts with the step-ups and side plank.
Scaling: Gentle warm-up: step instead of jumping, walk instead of jogging, comfortable range.
Easy flow targets: RPE Gentle 3–4, Steady 4, Strong 4–5, Full 5 (Zone 2, full sentences). Cap 20:00 · Aim: same easy bike pace every round · Feel cardio (easy) · Pace sustain.
No machine (warm-up/cool-down): jumping jacks, marching or jump rope, ~1:00 per 250 m or 5 cal.')
