insert into public.workout_coach_notes (class_date, body) values ('2026-12-18', 'Flex week: every session is optional (members pick 3–4); guests and on-ramp members join at Steady (Foundations), or Gentle if they need an easier start. Two coaches if possible. Run heats of 4 (one rower each) starting every 3:00; if rowers run short, members in a heat use the ''No machine free'' swap and note it. Members count their own reps; the coach records total time and the run 1 and run 4 splits on the scorecard. Benchmark: Full is the Rx standard so scores compare with the published version; every member records their level.
Scaling: Gentle warm-up: step instead of jumping, walk instead of jogging, comfortable range. Newer lifters / first 4 weeks: same sets and reps with empty bar or light plates at RPE 7. Gentle DB press at RPE 5–6. Lighter option: Gentle RPE 5–6 all the way; others drop to Gentle at RPE 6.
Strength: optional technique work, stop well short of RPE 8. Not a test.
Challenge targets: Cap 26:00 · Aim: Gentle/Steady finish under the cap, Strong 17:00–23:00, Full 15:00–20:00 · Feel cardio · Pace sustain (even run splits).
No machine (warm-up/cool-down): jumping jacks, marching or jump rope, ~1:00 per 250 m or 5 cal.')
